# The eval-set SHA (lab9.evalset.sha12) hashes raw bytes; the gate refuses a report whose
# eval_set_sha differs from the baseline's. Keep eval data LF on every OS (Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise turn it into CRLF and change the SHA).
src/data/eval/** text eol=lf
src/config/*.yaml text eol=lf
